        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: সম্প্রতি",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সম্প্রতি — sômprôti — \"recently\". Bengali's simple past adds -লাম for \"I\": আমি সম্প্রতি একটা বই পড়লাম — āmi sômprôti ekṭā bôi pôṛlām — \"I recently read a book.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সম্প্রতি (sômprôti) is Sanskrit saṁprati, \"now, at present\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
